I am getting ready for the office.
It is very hot today.
There is strong sunlight outside.
So I will wear light clothes today.
I open my wardrobe.
I have a new shirt.
It is white in color.
This shirt is made of cotton.
Cotton clothes are very good in the heat.
I put on my new white shirt.
It is very light.
I will not feel hot in it.
Now I am ready to go to the office.
It will rain this evening.
So I will take my umbrella along too.
I put the umbrella in my bag.
Now I step out of the house.
